  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently when trying to go to an Event the button to view the corresponding Groups Instances say \"Join\". This is a bit confusing in my opinion, as clicking on \"Join\" conveys to me as a user, that pressing this will make me directly join the instance for the Event.\n\nIt saying \"Join\" can make it a bit more scarier to click on, as users might not want to accidentally go to a different instance.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nRename the \"Join\" Button to \"View Instances\" to better represent what the button actually does.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a screenshot showcasing the current button:",
